:''Not to be confused with [[Ancient Egg: N006 (Special Cat)|Fallen Bear Cat]].''
'''Teacher BearCat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] added in [[Version 9.2 Update|Version 9.2]] who can be unlocked when beating the [[:Category:Advent Stages|Advent Stage]] [[Flow Like the Stream (Merciless)|Bottom of the Swamp]] appearing on the '''13th''', '''14th''', '''27th''', and '''28th''' of every month. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 9.10 Update|Version 9.10]] trades speed for [[Zombie Killer]], as well as targeting [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombies]] instead of [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] enemies.

